	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Portio Alfred Workflow

Manage your development projects from Alfred.

## Usage

1. Type `p` followed by a space to search projects
2. Select a project to see available actions:
   - Open in Cursor
   - Run Task
   - Open GitHub
   - Open Firebase Console
   - Open in Finder

## Keyboard Shortcuts

- **Cmd + Return**: Open project in Cursor directly
